  "changes": [
    "Share frozen preprocessing tables, defer diagnostic cost sweeps, and avoid single-raw-key temporary maps.",
    "Deduplicate repeated recipe identities without merging distinct source-sharing patterns; index wide input/byproduct lists in linear expected time with periodic cancellation checks.",
